| `make doc-review-apply` `[tree,cost]` | Applies one model-made edit per doc-review finding, each gated on `make check-docs`. | `make doc-review-apply` | [`models.default`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`agents.max_model_calls`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Spends model calls, and is refused with exit 2 unless `agents.max_model_calls` covers `--max-chunks` and a saved run it would resume is on the same model with no more chunks left; each call is counted, and the run stops at `--max-chunks` calls with exit 1; a red gate triggers journalled restoration, with `RollbackError` naming failed restores and retaining the journal for startup replay. | [doc-style.md](../guides/doc-style.md) | always |
